# TeiaCareVideoIO Changelog

## [0.2.3] - 2026-10-15
### Fixed
- One Conan recipe revision per release: version.cpp is generated in the build directory instead of the source tree
- Export only the library sources (tests/ and examples/ carried an OS-specific absolute data path)
### Changed
- CD deploys only on v* tags and uploads only teiacare_video_io/<version>, never "*"
- CI resolves third-party Conan 2 packages from teiacare_conan2; teiacare serves only teiacare_*

## [0.2.2] - 2026-04-21
### Changed
- Migrate build toolchain to Conan 2 and venvpp2
- Point scripts submodule to TeiaCare/venvpp2
- CI: increase coverage job timeout (5m → 20m) and gate Codacy on file presence
- CI: disable tests in Build step and examples in Unit Tests step
- CI: let conancenter resolve recipes before teiacare remote
